      "text": "To find the smallest positive value of \\( x \\) such that \\( x + 5678 \\) results in a palindrome, we need to determine the smallest \\( x \\) for which \\( x + 5678 \\) is a palindrome. A palindrome is a number that reads the same forward and backward.\n\nFirst, let's express the problem mathematically:\n- Let \\( p \\) be the palindromic number such that \\( x + 5678 = p \\).\n- So, we have \\( p = x + 5678 \\).\n\nFor \\( p \\) to be a palindrome, it must satisfy the condition that it reads the same forward and backward. We will start by checking the smallest palindromic numbers and work our way up.\n\n1. **Check \\( p = 11 \\):**\n   \\[\n   x + 5678 = 11 \\implies x = 11 - 5678 = -5667\n   \\]\n   \\( x = -5667 \\) is not positive.\n\n2. **Check \\( p = 101 \\):**\n   \\[\n   x + 5678 = 101 \\implies x = 101 - 5678 = -5577\n   \\]\n   \\( x = -5577 \\) is not positive.\n\n3. **Check \\( p = 111 \\):**\n   \\[\n   x + 5678 = 111 \\implies x = 111 - 5678 = -5567\n   \\]\n   \\( x = -5567 \\) is not positive.\n\n4. **Check \\( p = 121 \\):**\n   \\[\n   x + 5678 = 121 \\implies x = 121 - 5678 = -5557\n   \\]\n   \\( x = -5557 \\) is not positive.\n\n5. **Check \\( p = 1331 \\):**\n   \\[\n   x + 5678 = 1331 \\implies x = 1331 - 5678 = -4347\n   \\]\n   \\( x = -4347 \\) is not positive.\n\n6. **Check \\( p = 1441 \\):**\n   \\[\n   x + 5678 = 1441 \\implies x = 1441 - 5678 = -4237\n   \\]\n   \\( x = -4237 \\) is not positive.\n\n7. **Check \\( p = 1551 \\):**\n   \\[\n   x + 5678 = 1551 \\implies x = 1551 - 5678 = -4127\n   \\]\n   \\( x = -4127 \\) is not positive.\n\n8. **Check \\( p = 1661 \\):**\n   \\[\n   x + 5678 = 1661 \\implies x = 1661 - 5678 = -4017\n   \\]\n   \\( x = -4017 \\) is not positive.\n\n9. **Check \\( p = 17711 \\):**\n   \\[\n   x + 5678 = 17711 \\implies x = 17711 - 5678 = 12033\n   \\]\n   \\( x = 12033 \\) is positive.\n\n10. **Verify \\( x = 12033 \\):**\n    \\[\n    x + 5678 = 12033 + 5678 = 17711\n    \\]\n    \\( 17711 \\) is indeed a palindrome.\n\nThus, the smallest positive value of \\( x \\) such that \\( x + 5678 \\) results in a palindrome is:\n\\[\n\\boxed{12033}\n\\]",
